<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>Resetare parolă</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #0a0a0a;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #edf2f7;
      line-height: 1.65;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    }

    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #0a0a0a;
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #111111;
      border: 1px solid #1f1f1f;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .header {
      padding: 36px 40px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1f1f1f;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #151515 0%, #111111 100%);
    }

    .logo {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      width: 64px;
      height: auto;
    }

    .brand {
      color: #e0234e;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: #a0aec0;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .accent {
      height: 3px;
      background: #e0234e;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 36px 40px;
    }

    .greeting {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .message {
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      color: #cbd5e0;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .message strong {
      color: #e0234e;
    }

    .token-box {
      background-color: #0a0a0a;
      border: 1px solid #2d2d2d;
      border-left: 3px solid #e0234e;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .token-label {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #718096;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .token-code {
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background-color: #151515;
      border: 1px solid #2d2d2d;
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', Menlo, monospace;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
    }

    .token-expiry {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      color: #a0aec0;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .token-expiry span {
      color: #e0234e;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 24px 40px 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid #1f1f1f;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer p {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: #718096;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #e0234e;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .footer .brand-note {
      margin-top: 16px;
      color: #4a5568;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .wrapper { padding: 24px 12px; }
      .header, .content, .footer { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
      .header h1 { font-size: 22px; }
      .token-code { font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 4px; padding: 10px 14px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <img
          class="logo"
          src="https://nestjs.com/img/logo-small.svg"
          width="64"
          height="62"
          alt="NestJS"
        />
        <p class="brand">NestJS Auth</p>
        <h1>Resetare parolă</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Ai solicitat o parolă nouă pentru contul tău</p>
      </div>

      <div class="accent"></div>

      <div class="content">
        <p class="greeting">Salut!</p>
        <p class="message">
          <strong>Am primit o cerere de resetare a parolei.</strong><br>
          Folosește codul de mai jos pentru a seta o parolă nouă.
          Dacă nu ai cerut tu asta, poți ignora acest email.
        </p>

        <div class="token-box">
          <p class="token-label">Cod de resetare</p>
          <p class="token-code">{{token}}</p>
          <p class="token-expiry">
            Acest cod expiră în <span>{{expiresInMinutes}} minute</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>Nu partaja acest cod cu nimeni.</p>
        <p>
          Asistență:
          <a href="mailto:support@example.com">support@example.com</a>
        </p>
        <p class="brand-note">Powered by NestJS</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
